Description: ASRgwas is a comprehensive R package designed to perform
    Genome-Wide Association Studies (GWAS) using the modelling flexibility
    available in ASReml-R. This library assists with preparing and
    auditing phenotypic and genomic data; fitting GWAS models and
    identifying significant markers; and evaluating and exploring output.
